```mermaid
graph TD
    %% MedSynexa System Architecture Diagram

    subgraph Client Layer ["Doctor Interface & OPD Workflow"]
        A[Unstructured OPD Micro-Note / Vitals / Age] -->|Text or Voice| B[MedSynexa Clinical Copilot UI]
        C[Scanned Lab Report PDF / PNG] -->|Upload| D[OCR Lab Report Analyzer UI]
        E[Medical Guidelines / Textbooks] -->|Upload| F[Document & Vector Library UI]
    end

    subgraph API Gateway ["Node.js Express Backend"]
        B -->|POST /api/clinical/analyze| G[Clinical Controller]
        D -->|POST /api/reports/analyze| H[Report Controller]
        F -->|POST /api/documents/upload| I[Document Controller]
        
        G --> J[Auth Middleware & Rate Limiter]
        H --> J
        I --> J
    end

    subgraph RAG & Ingestion ["LangChain JS Pipeline & OCR Processing"]
        I --> K[Multer Storage Engine]
        K --> L[Text Extractor]
        L -->|Scanned PDF / Image| M[Gemini 2.5 Flash Vision OCR]
        L -->|Standard PDF / DOCX| N[pdf-parse / mammoth]
        M --> O[Recursive Character Text Splitter]
        N --> O
        
        O -->|500-1000 char chunks| P[LangChain Gemini Embeddings]
        P -->|text-embedding-004 768-dim| Q[Batch Rate-Limited Vectorization]
    end

    subgraph Persistence Layer ["Free Hybrid Storage (Local & MongoDB)"]
        Q -->|Vector Cosine Indexing| R[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
        I -->|Metadata & File Records| S[(MongoDB Database)]
        G -->|Audit Session Logs| S
        H -->|Lab Finding Analyses| S
        K -->|Permanent File Disk| T[Local Disk Storage /uploads]
    end

    subgraph Reasoning Engine ["LangChain LCEL & Gemini Reasoning Layer"]
        G --> U[LCEL Clinical Reasoning Chain]
        H --> V[LCEL Pathology Analysis Chain]
        
        R -->|Top-K Cosine Retrieval k=8-12| U
        R -->|Top-K Cosine Retrieval k=12| V
        
        U -->|Zod Output Schema| W[Gemini 2.5 Flash LLM]
        V -->|Zod Output Schema| W
    end

    subgraph Output Matrix ["Structured OPD Decision Outputs"]
        W --> X1[1. Ranked Differential Diagnoses with ICD-10]
        W --> X2[2. ICMR/NHP Localized Treatment & Indian Formulations]
        W --> X3[3. Real-Time Safety & Drug Interaction Flags]
        W --> X4[4. Diagnostic Next Steps & Lab Interpretations]
        
        X1 --> B
        X2 --> B
        X3 --> B
        X4 --> D
    end

    %% Style definitions
    classDef client fill:#0f172a,stroke:#14b8a6,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc;
    classDef backend fill:#0f172a,stroke:#06b6d4,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc;
    classDef storage fill:#0f172a,stroke:#10b981,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc;
    classDef llm fill:#0f172a,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc;

    class A,B,C,D,E,F client;
    class G,H,I,J,K,L,M,N,O,P,Q backend;
    class R,S,T storage;
    class U,V,W,X1,X2,X3,X4 llm;
```
